{
    "title": "Mancala Adventures\u2122 Board Game",
    "description": "Welcome to Mancala Adventures \u2013 the latest version of Africa\u2019s oldest strategy board game!\r\n\r\nExplore the rich history of Mancala board games (also known as Congklak, Mangala, Kalaha, Awale, Bao, Oware, Sungka, and Ayo). Strategically distribute marbles and outsmart your opponent to claim victory in Mancala Adventures board games!\r\n\r\nIn Mancala strategy board games, strategize turns, roll your marbles, unleash special power-ups, and become lord of the board!\r\n\r\n\u2b50<b>KEY FEATURES:</b>\u2b50\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5<b>USE POWER-UPS AND BOOSTERS</b>\ud83d\udca3\r\nExperience a classic Mancala match, now featuring special marble power-ups and boosters! \r\nIn Mancala strategy board games, the goal is to collect more marbles than your opponent!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udded<b>EXPLORE THE SAGA MAP</b> \ud83e\udded\r\nCompete in exciting Mancala board games duels and earn epic rewards!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 <b>TRAIN YOUR BRAIN</b> \ud83d\udca1\r\nChange your strategy as the levels intensify! Mancala board will put your skills to the test, much like in Checkers, Qwixx, Mangala - Ayo game, Fanorona, and Kalaha. Mancala (Oware), one of the world's oldest strategy board games is now available online!\r\n\r\n \ud83c\udfa9 <b>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</b> \ud83d\udc52\r\nUnlock beautiful cosmetics, and customize your character in Mancala online.\r\n\r\nEmbark on an epic Mancala Adventures and rule the board!\r\n\r\nPLAY Mancala Adventures strategy board games NOW!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Mancala Adventures \u2013 the latest version of Africa\u2019s oldest strategy board game!<br><br>Explore the rich history of Mancala board games (also known as Congklak, Mangala, Kalaha, Awale, Bao, Oware, Sungka, and Ayo). Strategically distribute marbles and outsmart your opponent to claim victory in Mancala Adventures board games!<br><br>In Mancala strategy board games, strategize turns, roll your marbles, unleash special power-ups, and become lord of the board!<br><br>\u2b50<b>KEY FEATURES:</b>\u2b50<br><br>\ud83d\udca5<b>USE POWER-UPS AND BOOSTERS</b>\ud83d\udca3<br>Experience a classic Mancala match, now featuring special marble power-ups and boosters! <br>In Mancala strategy board games, the goal is to collect more marbles than your opponent!<br><br>\ud83e\udded<b>EXPLORE THE SAGA MAP</b> \ud83e\udded<br>Compete in exciting Mancala board games duels and earn epic rewards!<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 <b>TRAIN YOUR BRAIN</b> \ud83d\udca1<br>Change your strategy as the levels intensify! Mancala board will put your skills to the test, much like in Checkers, Qwixx, Mangala - Ayo game, Fanorona, and Kalaha. Mancala (Oware), one of the world&#39;s oldest strategy board games is now available online!<br><br> \ud83c\udfa9 <b>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</b> \ud83d\udc52<br>Unlock beautiful cosmetics, and customize your character in Mancala online.<br><br>Embark on an epic Mancala Adventures and rule the board!<br><br>PLAY Mancala Adventures strategy board games NOW!",
    "summary": "Play Mancala! Strategy board game known globally as Congklak, Oware, Ayo & more.",
